Third-party components

This repository builds on the GGPP release:

  Prompt-Perturbation-in-Retrieval-Augmented-Generation
  https://github.com/Hadise-zb/Prompt-Perturbation-in-Retrieval-Augmented-Generation

The following files are copies of (or derived from) that release and remain the
work of its authors:

  DGD/DGD.py             byte-identical upstream copy, used as the "original" arm
  DGD/help_functions.py  upstream file plus a switchable query-wrapper parameter

They are redistributed here so that the paired comparison is reproducible. If you
use them, cite the original paper (see CITATION.cff) and observe the upstream
licence. Only the additions listed in the README fall under the MIT licence above.
